WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.210
The precious arms

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.210
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.190
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:39.500
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:39.500
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:49.000
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:49.000
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:04.150
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:04.150
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.460
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.460
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
This love...

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
Omoi wo

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:51.790
I'm sorry for taking so long.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.130
I've been longing to see you.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.130
Always, always waiting to see you...

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.430
I'm... not alone any more.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.230
A Good Word

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.230
'Morning!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:17.740
Hungry?

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:19.910
Hungry...

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.000
Yes.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.670
I'm glad. I was just about to come wake you.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.670
It's been so long since I had breakfast with someone.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.260
Kurau, this...

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.020
What shall we do after we eat?

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.480
Do you want to see the town?

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.520
Oh, yes! We have to buy you some clothes, too.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.980
Something you'll look good in.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:55.820
Oh, right! We have to think of a name for you!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.820
Name?

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:02.990
A name... something special, a good word.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.200
Christmas.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.920
How about Christmas?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:16.560
Yes.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.880
It's a really good word.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.840
It warms my heart.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:23.680
That's exactly what I thought.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.490
She's my little sister. isn't she cute?

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.420
Yes...

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.340
Say, Kurau, what's "little sister"?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.170
We'll just keep it that way, in this world.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:05.890
Until you get used to things, never go out alone. Okay?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.010
Yes!

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.890
All right! Let's continue shopping.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.230
Are we going to buy more?!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.190
Look how much we've bought.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.230
Are you worried?

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.260
Don't be. If I work, I can get money quickly.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:24.240
Work?

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:28.410
Yes... I have to work.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.840
If you don't work, you can't get money.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.010
And if you don't have money, you can't shop.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.120
Yes. Good thinking.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:56.290
Something did happen, didn't it, Kurau?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.650
I didn't tell you?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.020
That my little sister has come to live with me.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.860
Not that. I heard that.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.150
Something else good has happened, huh?

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.730
Like you found a boyfriend.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:08.840
Wrong.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.370
And these are all wrong.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.540
All these jobs are no good.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.410
I'll tell you one more time.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.790
I don't want to take on risky jobs any more.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.650
Risky jobs are all I offer.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.720
If you don't like that, go elsewhere.

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:33.270
That's right! I forgot that I can go elsewhere!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:33.270
H-Hey...

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.020
Thanks!

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.960
Wait! Wait!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.200
Man, my head is throbbing.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.360
Take care.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.690
I just remembered! There is one job...

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.740
I can tell you about it in one minute!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.410
The bodyguard of a rich man's idiot son.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:51.210
I didn't want to take this one.

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:54.040
But I owe his father big time.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:58.170
Everyone else is busy... so I was in a bind.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.090
An engagement party?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:13.180
I'll be back by dinnertime, so don't go outside.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.500
And if the doorbell rings, just ignore it.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.310
There's no one who would come to visit.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.020
Kurau, you look nice in clothes like that.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:23.730
Did you hear me?

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.610
Yes, I'll wait right here.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:32.320
Say... What kind of work do you do, Kurau?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:37.130
What kind? How shall I explain it.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:41.040
I forgot to tell you something very important!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.300
What is it?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:49.220
Do you... have power?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.010
Power?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:56.270
Rynax power... power 
which humans don't possess.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.310
Do you understand?

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.530
Not really.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:10.530
I see.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:15.330
If you feel any sensations, tell me immediately.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.160
Yes.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:24.750
I'll tell you everything, Kurau.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.460
Yes. Promise me.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.690
The guests all go through the reception desk.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:43.980
And the building seems to have 
been searched thoroughly.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.360
I don't see any work for me.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.530
Then just be bored.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.900
And get it out of your system.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:56.700
Hey, Agent! I told you not to leave my side!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.830
We're paying good money for you! Get to work!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.620
Are you that afraid of your ex-fiancée?

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.540
Women are a bother.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.800
Tell one you'll marry her, and
she'll become nice and sweet.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:12.420
But tell her you're leaving, and she'll pull out the knife she hid behind her back!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:17.430
If your ex is that jealous, shouldn't you be
more worried about your future bride?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.130
Life has a price.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:27.980
And you know whose life is
more expensive, don't you?

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.820
I could care less.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:35.810
And now, the groom-to-be Toshiki Ijima
would like to greet the guests.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.080
Mr. Ijima, a few words please.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.820
Honored guests, thank you very much

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.750
No wonder she was chosen to be the bride for the Ijima family...
for coming to our engagement party.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.670
No wonder she was chosen to be
the bride for the Ijima family...

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:46.690
With your kind support and encouragement,

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:49.690
She's beautiful and looks very happy.
With your kind support and encouragement,

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:49.890
She's beautiful and looks very happy.
I will continue to do my best at Ijima Group.

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:51.090
You think so?
I will continue to do my best at Ijima Group.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.380
I will continue to do my best at Ijima Group.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:56.840
It's a union to save the struggling business, but...

00:08:56.840 --> 00:09:00.390
It's a Cinderella story. Hopefully, the spell lasts.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.670
A spell cast by the Ijima Group.
It won't break that easily.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:08.360
They not only got a princess,
they got vested rights to the Blue Unit.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.440
I think Cinderella got the short end of the stick.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.150
Oh, that's terrible!

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:26.230
I wonder what Christmas is doing.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.300
I want to go home.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.510
What is it?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.220
I found one... can you check it out?

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.150
Found one? What?

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.220
A bomb.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:31.860
Are you all right?

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.530
Sorry! it's nothing.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.480
Let me see it.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:36.570
It's this.

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.700
Oh, that type, huh?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.100
It's not... flashing, huh?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.580
All right, remove the lipstick and let me see inside.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.810
It's an RK-2.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.580
You disarm it the same way as an RK-1.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.000
The make is simple, but 
the explosive power is big.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.460
If it exploded at the party,
there would've been casualties.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:58.970
Where did you find it?

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.970
Who placed it? The jilted ex-lover?

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.690
Doesn't seem like it.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:04.890
What?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.190
Then who is it?

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:08.930
Don't tell me he has other enemies?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.600
Well, I wouldn't know.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.330
I can't believe it...

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.600
If there are other bombs, it means trouble.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:16.670
What'll you do?

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:17.840
Easy.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.310
What?

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.990
I'll ask the person myself.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.030
When is Kurau coming home?

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:40.150
Geez, where'd you get hold of this?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.650
Who are you?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:46.660
An Agent. My job is to protect your fiancé.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.870
Protect? A man like that?

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.110
It doesn't matter to me what kind of man he is.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.540
You'll do anything for money, huh?

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:03.130
You're just like the rest of them.
Money, money, money!

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.350
If his ex is what you're worried about,
she's not coming.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:09.300
She never loved him that much.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.890
I don't want to marry 
a man like him either!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:19.270
But no one, including my 
parents, will understand!

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.570
No one!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.700
"Help me."

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.700
You wanted someone to help you?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:36.420
Even a toy-like bomb like 
this is deadly if exploded.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:39.540
I was...

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.920
Because... Because!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.640
I will take care of this.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:53.060
You should take care of your business, too.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.140
Take care?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:56.390
Yes...

00:13:56.390 --> 00:14:00.730
And you know, I don't just do it for the money.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.570
Hey you! Wait!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.780
Don't interfere with my work!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:12.830
Huh?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.200
The job's done. I've gotten rid of the bomb.

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:04.170
Night.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.920
I'm going straight home.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.090
Understood.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.060
I'm home!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.600
Welcome home, Kurau!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.720
You really cooked all this?

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.110
How?

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:28.240
I read a cookbook. Luckily,
we had all the ingredients.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.610
This is amazing!

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.320
Come on, eat!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.790
It's been a long time, Dr. Amami.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:42.540
I turned over all my research to you.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.540
And I've cooperated with the laboratory.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.340
So what does the GPO want with me now?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.840
The report that your subordinate
submitted ten years ago...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.180
At that time, it was impossible for
any of us to believe it.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.850
But it's different now.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.310
Rynax energy... it is an amazing achievement.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.400
About your daughter...

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.930
My daughter died! I told you!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.160
The Rynax phenomenon which occurred during an experiment...

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.350
I understand you lost your arm then.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.620
I came here to discuss something with you.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.960
We have had our eyes on this Agent.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.550
She is an exceptional Agent,

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.490
but her skills are far superior to humans.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:36.160
She must possess Rynax power.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:37.970
That is our belief.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.020
The problem is that...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:44.140
this woman is not registered in our list.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.400
An unlisted Ryna sapien...

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.230
she calls herself Kurau.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.740
Delicious!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:01.830
I'm so glad! I tasted it so many times.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.560
I thought it was good, but I wasn't sure if you would like it.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.710
What's wrong?

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:18.350
It has a... nostalgic taste.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.640
That's enough for today.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.440
Kurau is tired.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.610
We're not even halfway done.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.530
Let's continue.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:33.530
But...

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.780
Research funds aren't infinite.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:41.160
Besides, don't you want to proceed with
research for your daughter's sake?

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:43.830
But...

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.540
All right, Kurau. Hang in there for just
ten more minutes.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.130
Dad!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.010
Kurau...

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:05.100
I will protect you.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.350
I will!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:13.900
I used to live there with Dad.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.240
Dad?

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:17.820
Yes.

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:22.160
I come here often.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:25.750
When I'm sad... when I can't bear it any more.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:30.630
I fly from here... using my Rynax power.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:38.840
It was with my Rynax power that I injured Dad.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.140
I never meant...

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:46.490
for such a thing to happen to him!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.060
Dad!

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.730
Hang in there for just ten more minutes, Kurau.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:51.990
No!

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:53.390
I want to go home!

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:56.360
Come now... Don't be difficult.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.740
No!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.110
Stop!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.610
NO!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:01.370
What?!
NO!

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:04.340
Stop!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.480
Kurau!

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:25.560
It wasn't your fault, Kurau.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.390
They did bad things to you...

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.390
That's why...

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.940
Thank you.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.600
This is the first time I was able to talk about it.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:40.110
I wanted to tell someone for so long.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.780
Dad! Dad!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.740
Dad!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.780
It's all right, Kurau.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:51.960
It's going to be all right.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.300
Dad held me tightly.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:04.180
I didn't understand, but I felt a
tightening in my heart.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.770
I understand now, though.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.650
Do you want to see Dad?

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.070
Yes...

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:23.700
But Dad decided that we would live separately, in order to protect me.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.280
Kurau...

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.290
When we parted, Dad said that...

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:32.040
As long as I have the power, I will be pursued.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.880
Those were his words.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:39.750
I wonder if I have the power too.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.510
If you have the power, too...

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.680
You will also be pursued.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:55.730
Kurau...

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.900
I want to have powers like that!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:06.740
Because then, I could fly through the sky, right?

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:13.660
All right, let's fly!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:32.680
Christmas, I will protect you, without fail.

